\vspace{0.22cm}
{\Large\bfseries\color{ChapterJordan} 全書一句話 \textperiodcentered\ The Whole Book in One Verse}

\vspace{0.30cm}
\fcolorbox{ScriptureGold}{ScriptureBg}{%
\begin{minipage}{4.6in}
\centering\vspace{0.2cm}
\normalsize\color{CommentaryBrown}
耶和華應許賜福給以色列家的話，一句都沒有\textbf{\color{RestGreen!80!black}落空}，
都\textbf{\color{RestGreen!80!black}應驗}了。\\[0.5em]
\footnotesize\itshape
Not one of the good promises which the LORD had made to the house of Israel
failed; \textbf{all came to pass}.\\[0.4em]
\small\color{ChapterJordan} 約書亞記 21:45 \textperiodcentered\ Joshua 21:45
\vspace{0.2cm}
\end{minipage}}

\vspace{0.35cm}
{\small\color{TextGray} 二十四章 \textperiodcentered\ 五卷 \textperiodcentered\ 一句「一句都沒有落空」的信實見證\\
\textit{Twenty-four chapters \textperiodcentered\ five volumes \textperiodcentered\ one testimony that not a word failed}}

\vspace{0.30cm}
{\small
\renewcommand{\arraystretch}{1.3}
\begin{tabular}{@{}p{2.8cm}p{2.4cm}p{6.9cm}@{}}
\toprule
\textbf{段落} & \textbf{章節} & \textbf{在全書的展開} \\
\midrule
預備與信心：跨越約旦河 & 1-5章 & 摩西已死，約書亞受命；探子窺探，喇合搭救；全會眾在約旦河乾地上過河，於吉甲立石 \\
中央突破：耶利哥與艾城 & 6-8章 & 耶利哥城牆傾倒；亞干犯罪致艾城敗北；除罪之後，艾城攻克，以巴路山築壇立約 \\
南征北討，全地底定 & 9-12章 & 基遍人詭詐求和；南方五王聯軍潰敗，日頭停住；北方聯軍瓦解；三十一王盡數列冊 \\
地業均分，家家有份 & 13-21章 & 河東二支派半、迦勒、猶大、以法蓮、瑪拿西、餘下七支派逐一抽籤分地；設逃城，立利未城邑 \\
立約立志，至死不渝 & 22-24章 & 河東支派築壇為證；約書亞臨別勸勉；示劍立約，「至於我和我家，我們必定事奉耶和華」 \\
\bottomrule
\end{tabular}
}

\vspace{0.4cm}
\textcolor{ScriptureGold}{\rule{2.5in}{0.7pt}}
\vspace{0.3cm}

{\bfseries\color{ChapterJordan} 讀經之鑰 \textperiodcentered\ How to Read This Book}

\vspace{0.18cm}
\begin{minipage}{4.6in}
\small\color{TextGray}
不是來讀一部戰爭史或土地清冊，是來看神怎樣把祂在曠野中所應許的每一句話，
一件一件地兌現在一個世代的腳前。\\
若你讀完二十四章卻只記得「爭戰得勝」——請從頭再讀，\\
這次留意：得地之後最長的篇幅（13-21章），是逐支派、逐城鎮列出的分地清單——
神的信實不只落在戲劇性的神蹟裏，也落在最平凡瑣碎的產業清冊上。\\[0.5em]
\textit{\footnotesize
You are not reading a war chronicle or a land registry — you are watching God
make good, one tribe and one town at a time, on every promise He spoke in the
wilderness.\\
If after twenty-four chapters you remember only the battles, read it again.\\
This time notice: the longest section of the book (13-21) is a plain list of
inherited land — God's faithfulness lands as much in the tedious inventory as
in the miracle at the river.}
\end{minipage}

\vfill
{\scriptsize\color{LightGray} PubHub 三書精讀系統 \textperiodcentered\ Soli Deo Gloria}

